        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "The Mageseeker: A League of Legends Story",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Developed by Digital Sun, creators of Moonlighter, The Mageseeker: A League of Legends Story is an action RPG that takes place in the League of Legends universe. In the kingdom of Demacia, the Mageseekers hold the power to oppress magic-using citizens in the name of public order–by inducting and indoctrinating them, locking them away, or driving them into hiding.\n\nPlay as Sylas, a spell-stealing mage who has just broken free of his unjust captivity at the Mageseekers’ hands. Wielding the chains that once bound you, you must liberate your homeland from tyranny, one Mageseeker at a time.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Desarrollado por Digital Sun, creadores de Moonlighter, The Mageseeker: A League of Legends Story es un RPG de acción ambientado en el universo de League of Legends. En el reino de Demacia, los Buscamagos tienen el poder de oprimir a los ciudadanos que usan magia en nombre del orden público, reclutándolos y adoctrinándolos, encerrándolos o empujándolos a esconderse.\n\nJuega como Sylas, un mago ladrón de hechizos que acaba de escapar de su injusto cautiverio en manos de los Buscamagos. Empuñando las cadenas que una vez te ataron, debes liberar a tu patria de la tiranía, un Buscamagos a la vez.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2023",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
